# CQ1: 哪些 SKU 动销达标、毛利达标、且资质在有效期内 → 可报名大促
PREFIX :    <https://demo.local/ecat#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?sku WHERE {
  ?sku a :SKU ;
       :sales30d ?s ;
       :grossMargin ?m ;
       :hasCertification ?cert .
  ?cert :validUntil ?exp .
  FILTER(?s >= $MIN_SALES && ?m >= $MIN_MARGIN && ?exp > "$AS_OF"^^xsd:date)
}
